Compare the specification under ```{SpecPath}``` with the actual implementation and create Deliverables and AgentTasks to change the implementation to match the specification. Create Deliverables and AgentTaks in the Ready state when the architecture and technoloy choices are unambiguous. Create just a Deliverable in state NeedsReview if there are open questions or architecture and/or technology choices are ambigous.
The spec is the source of truth and the code must be changed accordingly.
